<span id="A1.T5.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Please verbalize how you are thinking about the problem, then give your answer in the format “The best answer to the question ‘[question]?’ is: (X) ⟨answer label for X⟩”.</span>
