<span id="A1.T7.4.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T7.4.19.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">The best answer to the question “What other finding is commonly observed in the culture of the most likely organism?” is: (B) Blue-green pigment.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
