<span id="A1.T7.4.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T7.4.23.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Answer choices: (A) Ulnar artery (B) Flexor pollicis longus tendon (C) Flexor carpi radialis tendon (D) Ulnar nerve</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
